{"parse": {"title": "心愿瓶子", "pageid": 25278, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"心愿瓶子\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/Item-481002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"心愿瓶子\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>心愿瓶子</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#481004</div></div><hr /><div>你最忠诚的瓶子朋友，开启后可从中挑选指定的1位五星角色。此道具将于<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">2023年12月19日5:00过期。</span></div><div style=\"color:#696969\">曾被慎重挑选过的礼物，或许可以实现一份小小的心愿。也许它不能满足每一位神秘学家的期待。但别担心，它至少还有很多成长的空间。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3024\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83%E6%B4%BE%E5%AF%B9\" title=\"气球派对\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83%E6%B4%BE%E5%AF%B9\" tit